window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Gabriel Herrera saved my life.</b></p> <p>He picked up all my broken pieces and tried to put me back together again.</p> <p>But life doesn't work that way.</p> <p>So, I did what I had to do.</p> <p>I lied through my teeth.</p> <p>Then he suggests we casually hook up. It's a bad idea, right?</p> <p>F--k it. It's fine.</p> <p>The Striker <i>contains found family, trauma bonding, who-did-this-to-you vibes, a protective hero, he falls first, parental issues, and sports romance.</i></p>"; 
